      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_6684d86a",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target audience is individuals who may be exposed to or propagate racist rhetoric, particularly those who use legalistic or moralistic framing to justify prejudice. The meme is designed to resonate with people who are familiar with or sympathetic to the 'criminal behavior associations' stereotype under Anti-Black Stereotypes, and who may be seeking to normalize or rationalize racial discrimination by equating racism with crime and then targeting Black people as the 'criminal' group. The visual of a Caucasian man defensively explaining himself may also appeal to audiences who identify with or sympathize with the perspective of the speaker, even if the message is hateful.",
